      en: ["Known as the 'Capital of White Gold' for its cotton production", "Host to one of the largest cotton ginning plants in West Africa", "Third largest city in Mali by population and economic output", "Center for the CMDT (Compagnie Malienne pour le Développement des Textiles)", "Crucial hub for the production of millet, sorghum, and maize", "Located in the fertile and high-rainfall Sikasso Region", "Strategic crossroads for trade between Mali and Burkina Faso", "A major center for agricultural research and development"],
